# rsync exclude list for shipping abiodun/ to a new system.
# Patterns are anchored to the abiodun/ transfer root (leading / = top-level only).
# Everything NOT listed here IS shipped (all code, docs, configs, checkpoints, OAI source, .git).

# --- Giant regenerable capture data (~360 GB) — regenerate via CARLA if ever needed ---
/fusion_training_data/

# --- Raw run streams (~159 GB) — the small summaries live in the study folders (shipped) ---
/metrics_logs/

# --- CoDriving platform (~11 GB) — re-clone from github.com/CollaborativePerception/V2Xverse ---
/V2Xverse/

# --- Torch cache (regenerated on first run) ---
/torch_cache/

# --- OAI compiled build tree — MUST be rebuilt on the new machine anyway (T-tracer) ---
/OAI/openairinterface5g/cmake_targets/ran_build/build/

# --- Python / editor noise ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
